# Lowyat.NET

> Lowyat.NET is Malaysia's leading technology news publication, delivering breaking tech news, gadget and mobile phone reviews, telco and internet coverage, gaming, automotive tech, and deals. Founded in 2002 by Vijandren Ramadass and operated by Lowyat Media Group (MSC-status), it reaches over 6 million unique visitors monthly. Content is published in English for a primarily Malaysian audience. This site (www.lowyat.net) is the editorial news portal; the separate community forum lives at forum.lowyat.net.

## Main sections

- [News](https://www.lowyat.net/news/): Breaking technology, business, and internet news relevant to Malaysia and the region.
- [Mobile](https://www.lowyat.net/mobile/): Smartphone launches, specifications, pricing, and hands-on coverage.
- [Hardware](https://www.lowyat.net/hardware/): PC components, laptops, peripherals, and computing hardware news and analysis.
- [Reviews](https://www.lowyat.net/reviews/): First-hand product reviews of phones, laptops, audio, and consumer electronics.
- [Telco](https://www.lowyat.net/telco/): Malaysian telecommunications, mobile plans, 5G, and broadband coverage.
- [Gaming](https://www.lowyat.net/gaming/): Video game news, hardware, and industry coverage.
- [Automotive](https://www.lowyat.net/automotive/): Automotive technology, EVs, and connected-car news.
- [Software](https://www.lowyat.net/software/): Apps, operating systems, security, and software news.
- [Lifestyle](https://www.lowyat.net/lifestyle/): Consumer tech lifestyle, culture, and trends.
- [Deals](https://www.lowyat.net/deals/): Verified promotions, discounts, and shopping deals in Malaysia.

